; Step 1 zone: positive answers only. DNSKEY and RRSIGs are added at load time.
; Short SOA minimum (60) so plain negative caching will not mask ANC in later steps.
$ORIGIN nsec.test.
$TTL 300
@       SOA   ns1 hostmaster 1 3600 600 86400 60
@       NS    ns1
ns1     A     127.0.0.1
www     A     192.0.2.1
www     TXT   "hello from nsec.test"
